hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1784","Umm al-Mu'minin Aisha Siddiqa (may Allah be pleased with her) says that this verse, ""Nay, the Hour is their appointed time, and the Hour will be more grievous and more bitter."" (Al-Qamar: 46), was revealed to Muhammad (peace be upon him) in Mecca, and at that time I was a little girl, playing."
